{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/873971bd21f65b70aa26726c481f620f.poster.avif?t=1757713674\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/873971bd21f65b70aa26726c481f620f.webm?t=1757713674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/873971bd21f65b70aa26726c481f620f.mp4?t=1757713674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only one stopping an alien invasion... and loving every second of it! In this remake of 2014's <i>Wrack</i>, play as <strong>Kain</strong> as you shoot, slash, and <strong>hyperblast</strong> your way through a horde of invading <strong>aliens</strong> and <strong>robots</strong> to keep your planet safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/e043d2fde0491b5c47055b5828e0e1d8.webp?t=1757713674\" width=616 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill Streaks</strong>: Rack up kill after kill to earn a <strong>kill streak</strong>! The more damage you pump into an enemy, the more extreme its death, and the more time you have to keep your streak going.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resets</strong>: Kill enemies a second time by exploding their corpse into giblets to <strong>reset</strong> your timer! Use your current weapon(s), or your <strong>melee</strong> attack to slice a corpse to bits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Movement</strong>: Use your fast movement speed and abilities, like a <strong>super jump</strong>, to evade enemy attacks, and find <strong>secrets</strong> and <strong>treasure</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/4fc754538750a9488d7f5d9c091bb521.poster.avif?t=1757713674\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/4fc754538750a9488d7f5d9c091bb521.webm?t=1757713674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/4fc754538750a9488d7f5d9c091bb521.mp4?t=1757713674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong>: When you're done racking up a huge kill streak, duke it out with <strong>minibosses</strong> and <strong>bosses</strong>... and put your skills to the test!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/6e2dd5fb4508887b641f4c3966e4f43d.webp?t=1757713674\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Weapons</strong>: Expand your arsenal with the addition of the <strong>gloogun</strong>, <strong>SMG</strong>, and <strong>railgun</strong>! (The Pulsar will return...) In addition, all weapons now have an <strong>alternate fire</strong> giving you a richer, more in-depth experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/cba790f3a693dbb7f9f52834b129a881.poster.avif?t=1757713674\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/cba790f3a693dbb7f9f52834b129a881.webm?t=1757713674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/extras/cba790f3a693dbb7f9f52834b129a881.mp4?t=1757713674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyperblasts</strong>: Build them up by dealing damage, and then <i>unleash</i> your powerful <strong>hyperblasts</strong> to take down tough enemies, or wipe out groups of weak ones!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unreal Engine</strong>: <i>Wrack</i> has been remade in <strong>Unreal Engine 4</strong>, to give you the most optimized, high-fidelity experience possible.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709080?t=1757713674","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/6aa7389ee44abaa2572c555c88f17489888df273/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757713674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/7055456125a4964110a9fedfc60c85c2ef7c2b2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757713674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709080/7055456125a4964110a9fedfc60c85c2ef7c2b2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757713674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Lea