/3709080/57e3b2dd188685328503c675dd0fb82f29c94340/ss_57e3b2dd188685328503c675dd0fb82f29c94340.600x338.jpg?t=1757713674"}],"short_description":"Inspired by classics like DOOM and Quake, Wrack is an arcade-style FPS. Mow down enemies one after another, and become more powerful the more you kill.\u00a0Amass a deadly arsenal, discover secret powers... and save your world!","steam_appid":3709080,"support_info":{"email":"bmc431@gmail.com","url":"http://www.wrackgame.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}